{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e5dd303e3208d126","name":"Mounted Combat","source":{"id":"source:reference-e5dd303e3208d126","title":"Mounted Combat","revision":21387,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:42:23Z","sha256":"90e4752f891566aba13fec6c6b6786f2df054863b6dbe10aec0e20f92eaf7039","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21387","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Mounted%20Combat&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e5dd303e3208d126","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You know how to get the most from a mount in combat and in other dangerous situations.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," You can make a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to spur your living mount to move faster than its normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},". If the check fails, your mount's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," does not increase and it moves -1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". If the check succeeds, your mount's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," increases by 2 squares until the start of your next turn. You cannot ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on this check. Your mount must succeed on a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," check prior to each subsequent attempt to use this feat in the same encounter.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, once per round, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", when you are riding a mount, you can negate a weapon hit against either you or the mount by making a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ride","referenceId":"reference:439efdc566bb419f"}," check. The DC of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," is equal to the result of the attack roll you want to negate.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
